{"4175080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHRAPNEL", "steam_appid": 4175080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Sacrifice Zone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2043. Five years ago, asteroid Sigma-38 collided with the Moon, carving a <strong>500km-wide band of devastation</strong> across Earth. This is the <strong>Sacrifice Zone</strong>, where lunar meteorites still rain down, bringing fresh deposits of <strong>Sigma</strong>—a volatile element with world-altering potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Valdacha Corporation walled off the sector to halt the initial looting chaos and has now authorized the first sanctioned <strong>Sigma Recovery Operation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> Deploy in a 4-person squad, secure the Sigma, and get out. But you aren't the only squad looking for a payout. The competition is armed, the environment is hostile, and the true power of Sigma remains unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/738264d9ef10eab1eda7e133daa1d92e.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/738264d9ef10eab1eda7e133daa1d92e.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/738264d9ef10eab1eda7e133daa1d92e.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stockpile: a 4v4 objective-based FPS with Operator abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4v4 objective-based FPS built around strategy, coordination, and risk management. In the flagship mode, <strong>Stockpile</strong>, your squad must secure and deposit <strong>300 grav-kilos of Sigma</strong> before the enemy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge the Craters:</strong> Wait for lunar meteorites to impact the Zone. Rush the craters, secure the fresh Sigma, and transport it to your <strong>Grav-Sync</strong>. But watch your timing—get too close to an impact, and you're dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid the Rival:</strong> Feeling aggressive? Assault the enemy base, steal Sigma directly from their Grav-Sync, and run it back to yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/4464da083205a94a6db07ee8af7b40cd.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/4464da083205a94a6db07ee8af7b40cd.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/4464da083205a94a6db07ee8af7b40cd.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Power of Sigma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sigma isn't just the score—it's the source of your power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression:</strong> Depositing Sigma empowers your <u><strong>Operator's abilities</strong></u> during the match. The more your team secures, the stronger you become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blackout Risk:</strong> If the enemy steals your stockpile and it hits zero, your abilities <strong>deactivate immediately</strong>. Recover Sigma to bring your systems back online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marked For Death:</strong> Carry too much Sigma and you're marked on the enemy's map with glowing footprints trailing behind you. Bank often to stay hidden, or go for the big score and become everyone's priority target?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/a4606b872fba46bdaeaf40c3c5aac167.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/a4606b872fba46bdaeaf40c3c5aac167.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/a4606b872fba46bdaeaf40c3c5aac167.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Your Operator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and evolve your Operator to fit your playstyle or your squad's needs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operator Progression:</strong> Unlock Operator perks that reflect your growing mastery and reinforce specific roles—mobility, recon, defense, or disruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Abilities:</strong> Deploy unique Sigma skills that upgrade in real-time as your squad secures deposits during a match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Roles:</strong> Adapt to the team composition - switch Operators during respawns to counter enemy tactics.<br><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/e7c0e6f6de9b53fd6a3d3d0e0afbab3e.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/e7c0e6f6de9b53fd6a3d3d0e0afbab3e.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/e7c0e6f6de9b53fd6a3d3d0e0afbab3e.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Operator: Perks and Traits Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Operator:</strong> Every match earns experience for your Operator, unlocking permanent access to powerful Traits and specialized Perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fine-Tune Your Stats with Traits:</strong> Build your core capabilities by selecting Traits that permanently boost Health, Movement Speed, Stamina, or Jump Height.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge a Unique Playstyle with Perks:</strong> Choose from random Perk draws to gain game-changing bonuses, such as faster reloads while carrying Sigma or increased damage when raiding enemy grav-syncs.<strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/d6d188cd00db07dc861a78e8516e5694.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/d6d188cd00db07dc861a78e8516e5694.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/d6d188cd00db07dc861a78e8516e5694.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Sharp</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Objectives:</strong> Grav-Sync deposit points relocate throughout the match, forcing constant adaptation in routing and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Respawns:</strong> The fight doesn't end until the contract is filled. Respawn on a short timer and swap Operators mid-match to counter enemy tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Storms:</strong> Meteor strikes deposit fresh Sigma at random locations, creating high-intensity hotspots.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/54f1f8d37dc7171ef2326d67b78b7d68.poster.avif?t=1775756842\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/54f1f8d37dc7171ef2326d67b78b7d68.webm?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175080/extras/54f1f8d37dc7171ef2326d67b78b7d68.mp4?t=1775756842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ <strong>Objective-Driven Intensity</strong> – Kills help, but securing Sigma wins. Routing, timing, and positioning determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ <strong>Emergent Combat</strong> – Rotating spawns, shifting objectives, and unpredictable storms reshape each match in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ <strong>Strategic Depth</strong> – A near-future arsenal where gun skill meets strategic coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Launching March 12, 2026: Wishlist now to join the first wave of Operators.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Sacrifice Zone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2043. Five years ago, asteroid Sigma-38 collided with the Moon, carving a <strong>500km-wide band of devastation</strong> across Earth. This is the <strong>Sacrifice Zone</strong>, where lunar meteorites still rain down, bringing fresh deposits of <strong>Sigma</strong>—a volatile element with world-altering potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 